## 📁 What Was Added

| File | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `src/models/evaluate.py` | The shared evaluation module. Every model is scored here, including XGBoost and the LSTM later |
| `src/models/baselines.py` | Four baseline types, five models in all |
| `scripts/run_baselines.py` | Fits the baselines on train and evaluates on val and test |
